# NV34 MiniGL config - this file must sit next to OpenGLLibrary in the game folder.# Every word turns on one flag. Lines starting with # are ignored.# Changes apply from the next game launch (no restart needed).# The nv34gl prefix may be omitted (showfps = nv34glshowfps). Boot-args still work.## --- display and fps ---# showfps      fps counter in the top left corner# nofps        no fps limit (otherwise at most 60)# fps30        at most 30 fps# fps75        at most 75 fps# queue        frames may queue up (the mouse may lag)## --- diagnostics (log in Preferences: NV34 MiniGL log.txt) ---# stats        timings every 250 frames to the log# debug        verbose log (slows things down)# noexc        do not catch crashes (EXCEPTION in the log)## --- workarounds ---# clrhw        hardware scissored clear (Max Payne cutscenes may flicker)# nomt         no multitexturing# notnl        no hardware T&L# nofog        no fog## Put the flags you want enabled here, e.g.:# showfps